    "tex": "$\\ce{Cr2O7^2- + 6Fe^2+ + 14H+ -> 2Cr^3+ + 6Fe^3+ + 7H2O}$",
    "grading": "選ぶ{$\\ce{Cr2O7^2- + 6Fe^2+ + 14H+ -> 2Cr^3+ + 6Fe^3+ + 7H2O}$|$\\ce{Cr2O7^2- + 3Fe^2+ + 14H+ -> 2Cr^3+ + 3Fe^3+ + 7H2O}$|$\\ce{Cr2O7^2- + 2Fe^2+ + 14H+ -> 2Cr^3+ + 2Fe^3+ + 7H2O}$}=1"
